This project began in 2026 as a fork of static-hosting
(https://github.com/convex/static-hosting), developed by Convex and licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Version 0.4 rebuilt the serving and deploy design around Cloudflare's asset
Worker; the git history of https://github.com/samebase/convex-hosting records the origin. Five
lines are still static-hosting's: the declaration of the component's generateUploadUrls mutation,
and its by_storageId index with the one lookup on it.

packages/convex-hosting/src/workers-sdk is copied from cloudflare/workers-sdk
(https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk: packages/workers-shared and the test cases of
fixtures/workers-shared-asset-config), developed by Cloudflare and licensed under the MIT License
or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option. The file UPSTREAM in that folder records the
copied commit, and scripts/sync-workers-sdk.ts refreshes it.
